From: Marionette AirDrop driver research
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] count a single STA MLD once in the monitor guard

The 0010 candidate passed ordinary association, then monitor creation was
rejected with 3 STA open sessions. The pinned single-netdev MLO path opens
internal link adapters as STA vdevs. Under the default-off 0009 experiment
only, normalize these to one logical STA only if all live STA objects belong to
one complete non-NULL MLD with a valid unicast address. The MLD object count
must match the observed live objects and cannot exceed open-session refs.
Legacy-AP association clears the MLO/link capability flags, so role flags
are diagnostic only; grouping uses the owned MLD context. Otherwise retain
the original rejection. Log role/count evidence without kernel addresses.
All other concurrency checks and same-channel restrictions remain.

